          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 74223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen fonksiyonların görevlerini yerine getirmelerine yardımcı olacak belirli bilgilere ihtiyacı olur. Örneğin, bir oyuncunun adını takıma ekleyen bir fonksiyon.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #F0F8FF&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Add Team Players&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Signup&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;playerInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;pInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot;&#xA;     placeholder=&quot;Enter a player name&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Current Team&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=playerList&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let number = 0;&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Team Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const player = document.getElementById(&quot;pInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Added: &quot; + player);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;playerList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variables in functions",
            "id": 74225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başlangıç olarak, fonksiyonların içinde sabitleri kullanabiliriz. <code> const name = \"Ron\";</code> oluşturup bunu görüntüleme ifadesinde kullanmak gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>name</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>\"Ron\"</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başlangıç olarak fonksiyonların içinde sabitleri kullanabiliriz. Örneğin <code>const name = \"Ron\";</code> oluşturup bunu görüntüleme ifadesinde kullanabiliriz. Selamlamanın <code>\"Hello, Ron\"</code> demesini sağlayan bildirimi tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Ron\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"Ron\"</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Similar code",
            "id": 74226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başka birini nasıl selamlardık? Benzer bir kodla yeni bir <code>greetLeslie();</code> fonksiyonu oluşturup çağırabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetLeslie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetLeslie();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"186\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greetLeslie()</code>, ardından <code>greetLeslie()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başka birini nasıl selamlardık? Benzer kodla yeni bir <code>greetLeslie();</code> fonksiyonu oluşturup çağırabiliriz. Leslie'nin fonksiyonunu tanımlarken ve çağırırken aynı adı kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetLeslie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetLeslie();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"186\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetRon()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetLeslie\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greetLeslie()</code>, ardından <code>greetLeslie()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing",
            "id": 74227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki fonksiyon yazmak yerine, kodu tekrarlamadan belirli bilgileri yalnızca bir fonksiyona aktarabiliriz. İşte kısa bir bakış.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;April&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, April\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>Leslie</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki fonksiyon yazmak yerine kodu tekrarlamadan belirli bilgileri tek bir fonksiyona aktarabiliriz. İşte kısa bir bakış.</p><p>İkinci çıktının <code>Leslie</code> adını selamlaması için mevcut fonksiyonu çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;April&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"April\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, April\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>Leslie</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
