          {
            "title": "Name",
            "id": 74228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyona değer geçirmek için önce fonksiyonun parantezlerinin içine <strong>parametre</strong> adı verilen bir değişken ekleriz. Burada <code>name</code> değerini geçireceğiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>name</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyona değer geçirmek için önce fonksiyonun parantezlerinin içine <strong>parametre</strong> adı verilen bir değişken ekleriz. Burada <code>name</code> değerini geçireceğiz. Bu parametreyi fonksiyon tanımına ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>name</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No value",
            "id": 74269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, bir değeri depolayan değişken gibi davranır. Ancak henüz içinde bir değer yok.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, bir değeri depolayan değişken gibi davranır. Ancak henüz içinde bir değer yoktur. Parametreyi selamlamaya eklenen değer olarak kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"const\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>name</code>, ardından <code>name</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing a value",
            "id": 74270,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişken için bir değer iletmek üzere fonksiyonu çağırırken bu değeri parantezlerin arasına yerleştiririz; <code>greet(\"Anna\");</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Anna\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>\"Anna\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, <code>name</code> gibi fonksiyon parantezlerindeki bir değişkendir. Çağrıda aktarılan değeri saklar.</p><p><code>greet(\"Anna\")</code> gibi çağrı parantezleri arasına bir değer geçir. Çağrının <code>Hello, Mia</code> göstermesini sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Mia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>greet</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>\"Mia\"</code>, <code>)</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
